! Material reference: HIBO Burnished CMU Veneer 4in Eq
! Scope: Retain gross layer thickness .0921 m (approximately 3-5/8 in). This is an equivalent hollow masonry layer, not solid concrete.
! Scope: 105-pcf concrete is the selected reference material category, not a verified HIBO unit density. Net concrete density is approximately 1681.94 kg/m3, while the energy-model gross/effective density is 832.319 kg/m3.
! Scope: The reference R includes mortar and void effects; film resistances are removed so EnergyPlus can calculate its own surface convection/radiation.
! Scope: Steady-state R and areal heat capacity are preserved for the selected reference assembly. Homogeneous k/rho/cp cannot reproduce every multidimensional hollow-block response.
! Scope: Burnishing, color, coating, actual web geometry, and actual aggregate are not established by these references. Optical defaults remain a declared convention.
! Scope: The Echelon manufacturer specification does not give a density class or numeric optical properties. The105-pcf CMHA reference category is a declared choice, not a product value.
! Source: EnergyPlus v22.2.0 ASHRAE_2005_HOF_Materials.idf; M05 200mm concrete block, lines 363-369; category only
! URL: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/EnergyPlus/blob/v22.2.0/datasets/ASHRAE_2005_HOF_Materials.idf
! Source: Supplied HIBO_Task1_Standard_Ground(1).idf
! Source: CMHA TEK 06-02C, R-Values and U-Factors of Single Wythe Concrete Masonry Walls + Supplied HIBO_Task1_Standard_Ground(1).idf; k=t/[(1.93-0.68-0.17)*0.17611018368230585]
! URL: https://www.cmha.org/resource/tek-06-02c/
! Source: CMHA TEK 06-16A, Heat Capacity (HC) Values for Concrete Masonry Walls + Supplied HIBO_Task1_Standard_Ground(1).idf; rho_eff=[3.3*20441.748028008555]/[880*0.0921]
! URL: https://www.cmha.org/resource/tek-06-16a/
! Source: CMHA TEK 06-16A, Heat Capacity (HC) Values for Concrete Masonry Walls; Calculating Heat Capacity: representative concrete cp=880 J/(kg K)
! URL: https://www.cmha.org/resource/tek-06-16a/
! Source: EnergyPlus v22.2.0 Input Output Reference, Material optical defaults; Material default optical fields
! URL: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/EnergyPlus/blob/v22.2.0/doc/input-output-reference/src/overview/group-surface-construction-elements.tex#L87-L97
! Source: EnergyPlus v22.2.0 Input Output Reference, Material optical defaults; Material default optical fields
! URL: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/EnergyPlus/blob/v22.2.0/doc/input-output-reference/src/overview/group-surface-construction-elements.tex#L87-L97
! Source: EnergyPlus v22.2.0 Input Output Reference, Material optical defaults; Material default optical fields
! URL: https://github.com/NatLabRockies/EnergyPlus/blob/v22.2.0/doc/input-output-reference/src/overview/group-surface-construction-elements.tex#L87-L97
Material,
    HIBO Burnished CMU Veneer 4in Eq,  !- Name
    MediumRough,             !- Roughness
    0.0921,                  !- Thickness {m}
    0.484229679367,          !- Conductivity {W/m-K}
    832.318730782,           !- Density {kg/m3}
    880,                     !- Specific Heat {J/kg-K}
    0.9,                     !- Thermal Absorptance
    0.7,                     !- Solar Absorptance
    0.7;                     !- Visible Absorptance

